  "beer-hagolah:6:ו": `Meaning from this house to another house via the walls — so is the view of those who forbid; but Beit Yosef ruled to permit, as appears from what he wrote above shortly; and behold this is the view of those who forbid; and above in siman 346 Beit Yosef brought both views:`,
