  "beur-hagra:10:_": `Seif 10 opposite reduction — scribal error:`,
  "beur-hagra:11:_": `Seif 11 helps — as Rosh answer:`,
  "beur-hagra:15:א": `Seif 15 tree, etc. — per Ramban as final:`,
  "beur-hagra:15:ב": `Rosh, etc. — Tosafos s.v. asherah; we rule as sugya there:`,
  "beur-hagra:15:ג": `Provided dry — else forbidden tree; Magen Avraham 26 study; no question — there stringency Shabbos 96 Rav found field, etc.; as stated:`,
  "beur-hagra:16:א": `Seif 16, etc. — there if annul partition, etc.:`,
